    "description": "Cargo platform scales comprising an Atrax CDI-1600 indicator connected to a weighing platform, forming a family of Class III, self-indicating, single-interval, non-automatic weighing instruments. The instruments are not designed for direct sales to the public. Indicator features: stainless steel enclosure with panel mount bracket or tilt stand, colour LCD display, 27-button keypad, connections and ports on bottom face. Platform frames: CRF (Cargo Roller Frame) with rollers or conveyor belt on SBM-2T mounts; CPF (Cargo Platform Frame) with or without rollers on SBM-5T mounts; CVF (Cargo Vehicle Frame) pit-mounted heavy-duty platform with weigh beam modules on DSB-25klb mounts (4 or 6 load mounts). Loads are transferred on and off the platform after static weighing only. Legally relevant software version V2.xx.xx."
